---
import EmailLink from '../components/EmailLink.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="How this website uses analytics.">
	<PageHeader eyebrow="Privacy" title="Privacy" lead="A short note on what this site measures." />
	<div class="container-site">
		<div class="max-w-2xl space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-body">
			<p>
				This site uses Google Analytics to understand how visitors find and use it: which pages are viewed, the site
				that referred you, your approximate location (city level), and your device and browser. Google Analytics sets
				cookies to tell new and returning visitors apart. It does not store IP addresses.
			</p>
			<p>
				If you are signed in to a Google account with ad personalization turned on, Google may also use that sign-in
				to provide aggregated demographic and interest reports (Google signals). These reports do not identify
				individual visitors.
			</p>
			<p>
				The site has no ads, sells no data, and does not ask for names or contact details. The figures are aggregate
				statistics used only to improve the site.
			</p>
			<p>
				To opt out, use your browser's privacy settings, a content blocker, or Google's <a
					href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout"
					class="link">opt-out add-on</a
				>. Questions are welcome at <EmailLink variant="text" />.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>
